⚠ Security level Moderate: your Corbanu home is reached through a link (/home/
  user/.corbanu) in a folder agent commands can write, so a command could
  replace it and the next start would use another folder without your security
  level. Start Corbanu Terminal with CORBANU_HOME=/home/user/dotfiles/corbanu to
  close this.
